#-------------
POLEVAULT ZOMBIE
#-------------
Biomes 	      	 - All BUT Mountains
Spawn Conditions - N/A
Rarity           - 4/10 (10/10 is SUPER RARE)
Tag              - N/A
#-------------
ARMED STATS
#-------------
HP 		 - 25
DMG		 - 4/6/8
RNG		 - 2 + 2
SPE		 - 0.2 or 0.25, whichever is faster (I don't know MC code)
#-------------
QUIRKS
#-------------
Pole Vault Stick acts like a spear with Lunge III when you M1 with it.
The Polevault Zombie must use this to attack, rather than the M2 "charge."
Reference the code of how Skeletons / non-Zombies use spears, if you need to.
The Polevault Zombie jumps when attacking nuts or other walls.
This is so that it can get OVER them, like in the games.
It also needs to lose aggro after attacking anything but a Tall Nut.
